{"book":"ezekiel","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:48:41.273987348Z","verse":20,"ref":"ezekiel 3:20","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":3,"translation":"And when a righteous ⟨man⟩ turns from his righteousness and does injustice, and I set a stumbling-block before him, he shall die — because you did not warn him, in his sin he shall die, and his righteous deeds that he did shall not be remembered, and his blood I will require from your hand.","tokens":[{"surface":"ובשוב","gloss":"And when ⟨he⟩ turns"},{"surface":"צדיק","gloss":"the righteous"},{"surface":"מצדקו","gloss":"from his righteousness"},{"surface":"ועשה","gloss":"and does"},{"surface":"עול","gloss":"injustice"},{"surface":"ונתתי","gloss":"and I place"},{"surface":"מכשול","gloss":"a stumbling-block"},{"surface":"לפניו","gloss":"before him"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"he"},{"surface":"ימות","gloss":"shall die"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"because"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"הזהרתו","gloss":"you warned him"},{"surface":"בחטאתו","gloss":"in his sin"},{"surface":"ימות","gloss":"he shall die"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and ⟨they shall⟩ not"},{"surface":"תזכרן","gloss":"be remembered"},{"surface":"צדקתו","gloss":"his righteous deeds"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"עשה","gloss":"he did"},{"surface":"ודמו","gloss":"and his blood"},{"surface":"מידך","gloss":"from your hand"},{"surface":"אבקש","gloss":"I will require"}]}